<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Sat, 22 Aug 2026 00:33:03 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>独家：亚马逊一夜之间悄悄提高了 Echo、Fire TV、Kindle 和 eero 的价格，以抵消内存成本的“大幅上涨”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/21/exclusive-amazon-quietly-hiked-prices-echo-fire-tv-kindle-eero-significant-increases-memory-costs/</link><description>苹果、戴尔和微软 Xbox 也采取了类似举措，这家电子商务公司的硬件价格也随之上涨。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2201505685-e1787356134569.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 23:50:35 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/21/exclusive-amazon-quietly-hiked-prices-echo-fire-tv-kindle-eero-significant-increases-memory-costs/</guid></item><item><title>亚历克斯·琼斯 (Alex Jones) 不再为桑迪·胡克 (Sandy Hook) 家族所欠 5000 万美元的债务所困扰，但他仍有 12.5 亿美元的债务悬而未决</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/21/alex-jones-50-million-sandy-hook-families-1-25-billion/</link><description>Infowars 的创始人只能被迫从德克萨斯州法院支付约 600 万美元，但康涅狄格州仍有高达 12.5 亿美元的单独判决。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-1425979492-e1787347907602.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 21:36:41 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/21/alex-jones-50-million-sandy-hook-families-1-25-billion/</guid></item><item><title>共和党人表示让他们吃价格过高的汉堡，指责特朗普“用外国牛肉充斥市场”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/21/republicans-donald-trump-beef-import-announcement-consumers-expense/</link><description>美国养牛者协会主席贾斯汀·塔珀（Justin Tupper）表示：“将美国养牛生产者放在最后并不能将美国放在第一位。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2290507653-e1787347370864.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 21:27:22 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/21/republicans-donald-trump-beef-import-announcement-consumers-expense/</guid></item><item><title>亚马逊、Uber、DoorDash 和沃尔玛正在将送货大战推上天空</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/21/amazon-uber-doordash-walmart-drone-delivery-wars/</link><description>经过多年的实验和挫折，美国一些最大的快递公司正在竞相让无人机成为主流。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2287919551-e1787254063144.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 07:03:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/21/amazon-uber-doordash-walmart-drone-delivery-wars/</guid></item><item><title>人工智能的繁荣正在提振整个亚洲的经济。但对于东南亚来说，这可能只是“短期现象”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/21/asia-ai-boom-southeast-asia-economic-geopolitical-divide-short-term-blip/</link><description>研究该地区的经济学家担心人工智能的收益不会在整个亚洲平均分配。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2182348720.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 21:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/21/asia-ai-boom-southeast-asia-economic-geopolitical-divide-short-term-blip/</guid></item><item><title>首席大法官约翰·罗伯茨允许特朗普的舞厅工作人员每天继续工作 20 小时</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/21/trumps-ballroom-roberts-supreme-court/</link><description>白宫表示，尽管法院正在测试总统翻修权力的限制，但私人资助的项目已完成 65% &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AP26226673787119-e1787345103676.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 20:56:25 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/21/trumps-ballroom-roberts-supreme-court/</guid></item><item><title>YouTube 向创作者提供数百万美元不与 Netflix 合作的机会</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/21/youtube-netflix-millions/</link><description>YouTube 明星打造了流媒体新的黄金时段，而现在 Netflix 却迫使其付费才能留住他们&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-936980924-e1787344487279.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 20:38:07 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/21/youtube-netflix-millions/</guid></item><item><title>肥土拨鼠周的领导者与预算削减时代作斗争：“当泰坦尼克号沉没时，我们将笑着沉没”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/21/fat-marmot-week-climate-change-colorado-titanic/</link><description>科罗拉多州哥特市的土拨鼠研究人员亲切地称自己为“土拨鼠”。资金削减已经导致三分之一的研究生丧生。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AP26232795593218.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 20:36:08 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/21/fat-marmot-week-climate-change-colorado-titanic/</guid></item><item><title>特朗普承认关税是对美国人对汉堡包的热爱征税，并允许以“低于当前市场价格”进口30万吨碎牛肉</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/21/donald-trump-tariffs-300000-tons-ground-beef-imports/</link><description>“关税只是对美国消费者征税，”经济学家史蒂夫·汉克说。与此同时，养牛团体对总统的职位感到“失望”。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2290596908-e1787327444700.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 15:56:28 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/21/donald-trump-tariffs-300000-tons-ground-beef-imports/</guid></item><item><title>忘记 RTO：针对 7,700 名员工的最新研究发现，完全远程办公的员工幸福感最高，而且辞职的可能性较小</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/21/work-from-home-major-study-remote-workers-well-being-less-likely-to-quit-despite-ceos-like-musk-dimon-push-rto/</link><description>研究发现，几乎没有证据表明远程办公人员感觉与同事或工作场所文化的联系较少——尽管杰米·戴蒙 (Jamie Dimon) 等首席执行官都这么说。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2255638748-e1787325856340.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 15:35:45 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/21/work-from-home-major-study-remote-workers-well-being-less-likely-to-quit-despite-ceos-like-musk-dimon-push-rto/</guid></item></channel></rss>